OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after two men stabbed at
OL,4,Apopular waterfront
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after two men
OL,7,Fwere stabbed at a popular waterfront
OL,8,Farea, police have said.
OL,10,FKent Police said officers were called
OL,11,Fto Ramsgate Harbour at 04:45 BST,
OL,12,Ffollowing reports of a man with a
OL,13,Fknife.
OL,15,FTwo men, one in Harbour Street and one
OL,16,Fin Harbour Parade, had sustained
OL,17,F"serious" injuries consistent with stab
OL,18,Fwounds, said the force. Both men were
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
